<description>&lt;p&gt;UNMISS patrols continue in Tonj North while peace talks are held in Tonj East to curb intercommunal clashes, and the government has set conditions for Dr Riek Machar's return to Juba. A drone strike killed at least 153 people and a plane crash killed 14, adding large-scale fatalities to the crisis. A lightning strike killed a 60‑year-old man in Juba. Uganda demanded $4.3 million from Kenya over the killing of UPDF soldiers and geologists in Turkana. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOdDN4ZmVNeHRNX0pHR2M4em4zZUFhV2dXdkdzQWp3SHFGWWZVdGg5aGJsaldrR1JMVkRQcVBOa0s2NENlSk9rRWZTR1FReTB1S2FpN19vX08waU8xcUVvb05INjF2czFEeU1BY2hpMmpwQXpVcVRlaWY5UkhuQkdLZjBCNmlBMnA4TWhz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mirage News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE5KZEdQeFQ2Ym5heG1VeDlJcXNvZkstTldYd2hQOUtJdUplVTZhUWVmbVdmMzNoWnN3OWdrd3F0X2lCMFRHMUhiYXV2cWozQmVIZlFielU0RnViX0ZVYTFVMGZCTVlwVEY2cVRIbGRuZTN0SVlCLW5vVTJ2aDE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Oxfam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQcDg3VDNDcF9HOHBmdUdHYndoVXhtWlM3eHgtZm16NUh3bHFOb2c2Q0NEbThkWTNFTUxRdHh5Ti04bDB5b2FaOVU5ZFNETEhMVjZoWmFETmdzX3ozeGNnSC1tYkZOODBKWTY1UUxDR1dULVkxWlNGLUlScHdMeUUzU2RWY0hSdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mirage News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTEFVX3lxTE9mcE1nUUgyY0lUbGdkVEszd2toZzNkTGE0ODZrWEtnWmZqTFlsNnlZYmE3OEhQYTNtYlJvYnZxNnNXeFJXclN5NnFBWnQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN Meetings Coverage and Press Releases&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxNRUVabkx1TG9mazNsbXU0S0Nqc3ZvY2VNYjFIV3V5SVNnVExwc2tRVy0tQkhCQWR6X0Q5RXBraTdNeXJVejYyMFN2M2RPR2hYUXZPSWVHRlNwZWJ1N2VSbjVCT2prUU5vbm9ZNWJ6RVVCbjY1eFRIcnpuRy13QndDY3dlRkRYMEMwNU9NbUlsb09QR2tN?oc=5&quo